**Scope design:**
| `setting_scope` | Who can update | Examples |
|----------------|----------------|---------|
| `user` | Any authenticated user | theme, timezone, notification_email |
| `system` | admin / super_admin only | confidence_threshold, agent toggles |

**Locked policy:** `human_approval_required = 'ENFORCED'` is never stored as a toggle. The UI shows a locked badge — not a switch.

